1022
00:53:53,644 --> 00:53:58,144
Your economists publish papers explaining why this was obvious in retrospect.

1023
00:53:58,884 --> 00:54:00,304
Year twenty forty:

1024
00:54:00,324 --> 00:54:01,924
The compounding kicks in.

1025
00:54:02,324 --> 00:54:06,864
Healthier people work more, earn more, spend more, fund more research, which

1026
00:54:07,004 --> 00:54:10,084
